<!--
  Project actions: saving the work and opening it again.

  An outlined tray with an arrow resting into it. Deliberately not a floppy
  disk, which reads as "save" alone, and deliberately not a folder, which
  promises a browser this product does not have: one durable project slot is
  what exists, and the glyph says "put the work down / pick it up again".

  Drawn white and tinted at use; see EditorControlStyles.icon().
-->
